/* Cocaine — updates and signature (zh-Hant) */

"Updates" = "更新";
"Check for updates automatically" = "自動檢查更新";
"Once a day. Nothing is downloaded until you press Install." = "每天一次。在你按下「安裝」之前不會下載任何內容。";
"Check now" = "立即檢查";
"Install" = "安裝";
"Download" = "下載";
"Retry" = "重試";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Copy command" = "拷貝指令";
"Not checked yet" = "尚未檢查";
"Last checked %@" = "上次檢查 %@";
"Checking…" = "正在檢查…";
"Cocaine is up to date" = "Cocaine 已是最新版本";
"Version %@ is available" = "版本 %@ 可供使用";
"Version %@: update with Homebrew (brew upgrade --cask cocaine)" = "版本 %@：請用 Homebrew 更新（brew upgrade --cask cocaine）";
"Version %@: this build can't verify updates; download it from GitHub" = "版本 %@：此版本無法驗證更新；請從 GitHub 下載";
"Version %@: this build is signed ad hoc; download it from GitHub" = "版本 %@：此版本為臨時簽署；請從 GitHub 下載";
"Version %@: move Cocaine to Applications first" = "版本 %@：請先將 Cocaine 移到「應用程式」";
"Version %@: Cocaine's folder isn't writable; download it from GitHub" = "版本 %@：Cocaine 所在資料夾無法寫入；請從 GitHub 下載";
"Downloading… %d%%" = "正在下載… %d%%";
"Verifying and installing…" = "正在驗證並安裝…";
"You're offline." = "你目前離線。";
"Not enough disk space for the update." = "磁碟空間不足，無法更新。";
"The download didn't match the signed release and was deleted." = "下載內容與已簽署的版本不符，已刪除。";
"Refused a download from outside GitHub." = "已拒絕來自 GitHub 以外的下載。";
"Couldn't reach GitHub. Try again later." = "無法連線至 GitHub。請稍後再試。";
"The new version failed the authenticity check. Nothing was installed." = "新版本未通過真實性檢查。未安裝任何內容。";
"The release on GitHub isn't usable for an update." = "GitHub 上的版本無法用於更新。";
"Cocaine can't write to its folder. Download the update from GitHub." = "Cocaine 無法寫入其所在資料夾。請從 GitHub 下載更新。";
"The update couldn't be installed. Nothing was changed." = "無法安裝更新。未做任何變更。";
"This copy's signature can't be read." = "無法讀取此副本的簽署。";
"Installed. Quit and reopen Cocaine to start the new version." = "已安裝。結束並重新開啟 Cocaine 以啟動新版本。";
"Signature: missing or damaged. Reinstall Cocaine." = "簽署：遺失或已損壞。請重新安裝 Cocaine。";
"Signature: ad hoc. macOS forgets the permissions at every update." = "簽署：臨時簽署。每次更新後 macOS 都會忘記權限。";
"Signature: self-signed, not verified by Apple. Permissions carry over only to updates signed with the same certificate." = "簽署：自我簽署，未經 Apple 驗證。只有使用同一憑證簽署的更新才會保留權限。";
"Signature: a certificate that isn't Cocaine's or Apple's." = "簽署：既不屬於 Cocaine 也不屬於 Apple 的憑證。";
"Signature: Developer ID, not notarized." = "簽署：Developer ID，未經公證。";
"Signature: Developer ID, notarized by Apple." = "簽署：Developer ID，已由 Apple 公證。";
